      "content": "<h5>About</h5>The Polarion REST API lets you interact with Polarion programmatically. Use this API to integrate Polarion with your applications. This page documents the REST resources, including the HTTP response codes and example requests and responses. <br/><br/>For a detailed description of the REST API and how to use it, see the <a href=\"https://docs.sw.siemens.com/en-US/doc/230235217/PL20250606201928474.polarion_help_sc.xid2134849/xid2134871\" target=\"_blank\">REST API User Guide</a> (available on Support Center).\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Polarion REST API Support",
